 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2017-05-22",
   "text": "Health Care Options for All Act\n This bill amends the Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act to require the Department of Health and Human Services to ensure that individuals eligible to purchase coverage through a health insurance exchange who reside where no exchange health plans are available may enroll in coverage offered in the small group market through the Washington, DC exchange."
  }
